# Measured off base/art/back.jpg (the base cartridges' shared plate,
# manual from the hero, no lettering on it), as fractions of its width
# (728px): the gold fillet's top at 0.044 and its bottom at 1.218, its
# sides 0.043 in; the blind-embossed laurel roundel between 0.40 and
# 0.92; the darker band from 1.231 to 1.335. The plate is shared:
# compose with `covers.py back <feature> --plate base`. The screenshots
# take the top of the face; the strip is the pattern's defaults off
# NAME_Y.
